/-- **Sharp 3-Obligation `H2d` Reduction & Honest `OPEN` Status (`C/B/X`)**:
1. `Fintype.card H2dCoreObligation = 3` and `FullH2dClosure D ↔ ∀ o, D.Satisfies o`,
