/-- **Bridge to `H2dUVMultiscaleAndIRPremise.cauchy_convergence_diagonal` (`[C/B/X]`)**:
Demonstrates *exactly* how `scale_decaying_mz_contraction_to_zero`,
`stagewise_rescaled_irrelevant_sector_contraction`, and `two_loop_asymptotic_freedom_running_bounds`
discharge `CauchySeq (fun n => S_n n psi psi)` inside `H2dUVMultiscaleAndIRPremise`:
- `[C/B/P]` supplies 2-loop `g_k^4` summability, `M-33.4` rescaled irrelevant contraction
  `L'_k ≤ kappa < 1`, and `scale_decaying_mz_contraction_to_zero` uniform summability of `r_k`;
