/-- Direct `[C/B/P/X]` adapter from `Round06IRTrackBundle` into `H2dIRIrreduciblePillar`,
constructively discharging `hzegarlinski` via `round05_ir_zegarlinski_conditional_bridge`. -/
noncomputable def irTrackToIRPillar (B : Round06IRTrackBundle) :
    H2dIRIrreduciblePillar (irTrackToIRContext B) where
